			<a class="td-soft-logo-link" href="https://www.teknodayim.com/" rel="home" aria-label="Teknodayım"><img class="td-soft-logo" src="https://www.teknodayim.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/comp_logo_td.png" alt="Teknodayım" height="60" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high"></a>		</div>

		<nav class="td-soft-sticky-nav" aria-label="Hızlı menü">
